    "%lld 道到期 · 错题本共 %lld 道。复习答对升一级，答错回到第一级。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$lld due · %2$lld in total. Answer correctly to move up a level; a wrong answer sends it back to level 1."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld 道开放题来自各章自测与复盘。先合上书讲出来，再对照参考答案自评。已掌握 %lld/%lld，%lld 张待练。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Open-ended questions (%1$lld) from every chapter’s self-checks and reviews. Close the book, say your answer out loud, then compare with the reference and rate yourself. Mastered %2$lld/%3$lld, %4$lld due."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld 道开放题来自各章自测与复盘。先合上书讲出来，再对照参考答案自评。已掌握 %lld/%lld，%lld 张待练。完整版再解锁 %lld 张。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Open-ended questions (%1$lld) from every chapter’s self-checks and reviews. Close the book, say your answer out loud, then compare with the reference and rate yourself. Mastered %2$lld/%3$lld, %4$lld due. Full Version unlocks %5$lld more."
          }
        }
      }
    },
