    "一次购买，永久解锁，无订阅。购买记录跟随你的 Apple 账号，换设备可恢复购买。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "One purchase, unlocked forever. No subscription. Your purchase is tied to your Apple Account and can be restored on any device."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "一课约 10～15 XP。每天至少完成一次学习就能续上连胜；每连续 7 天奖励一次连胜保护。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A lesson is worth about 10–15 XP. Finish any lesson each day to keep your streak going. Every 7 days in a row earns a streak freeze."
          }
        }
      }
    },
