    },
    "先说结论，再讲原因，举一个会出错的反例，最后说清方案在什么前提下成立。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Start with the conclusion, explain why, give a counterexample where it breaks, and finish with the conditions under which your design holds."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "先读题预测结果，再运行场景对照。完成一个实验即可点亮这一关。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Read the question and predict the outcome, then run the scenarios to compare. Finish one lab to light up this level."
